<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n85908" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσῐς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ιος</span>, 
			Att.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ;</span> dat. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσει,</span>
		
			Ion.
		
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.19
				</span></i>
			: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πίνω</span>):— <i>drinking,
				drink, beverage,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσιος καὶ ἐδητύος ἐζ ἔρον ἕντο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.469
				</span></i>
			, al.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρῶσίς τε π. τε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					10.176
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				395
			</span></i>: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βρώσεσιν ἢ πόσεσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Democr.
					235
				</span></i>
			; <i>carousal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Alc.
				101
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Critias
				6.9
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συγγίνεσθαι ἐς πόσιν</span> to
			meet for a <i>carousal,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				1.172
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Bull.Soc.Alex.</u>
				7.66
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὸς πόσιν τετράφθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					7.73
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λιπαρέειν τῇ πόσι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					5.19
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρὰ τὴν π.</span>”
				<i>over their cups,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.121
				</span></i>
			.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δ́; ἐκ δὲ θοίνας π. ἐγένετο, ἐκ δὲ
					πόσιος μῶκος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Epich.
					148
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσιος ἐν βάθει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Theoc.
					14.29
				</span></i>
			: pl., <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				641a
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>draught,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">αἷμα πίεται τρίτην πόσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Ch.</u>
					578
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐκπίνειν ὑστάτην π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antipho
					1.20
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πόσις φαρμάκου</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.22
				</span></i>
			.</div>
